 > bug?	- I quaffed from a fountain and briefly saw all objects on the
 > 	level, like in 3.0j.  However, they didn't disappear but stayed
 > 	on the screen.  When I got to some of them they disappeared as
 > 	I moved onto that coordinate, because some monster had removed
 > 	them since they were drawn.  BTW, even ^R insists on redrawing
 > 	those objects (hence the questionmark; is this a *feature*?)

This is a feature! The object stays on the screen, so you dont have to
write on the terminal. (-: I used fingerprints on the dusty screen. :-)
An object don't disappear if a monster later picks it up, for how can
you know it has been picked up when you can't see it from where you 
stand?  This was a bug in 3.0 that has now been corrected.  Now it is
impossible to trace leprechauns by dropping gold pieces everywhere...

